Notebook[{Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["bandplot", "ObjectName"],
     Cell[TextData[{Cell["   ", "ModInfo"], Cell[BoxData["bandplot[path, n, ham, rules]"], "InlineFormula"], "  ", "d\
raws the numerical eigenvalues of ham along a labeled reciprocal-fractional path after applying parameter rules."}],
      "Usage"], Cell["Each path segment has the form {{k1, k2}, {label1, label2}}. The two momentum points contain \
three reciprocal-fractional coordinates.", "Notes"], Cell["n is the number of subdivisions per segment, so each segment \
contains n + 1 sampled points. Momentum coordinates are multiplied by 2 Pi before substitution into ham.", "Notes"],
     Cell["rules must supply numerical values for every free parameter in ham.", "Notes"],
     Cell["At a discontinuity between two consecutive segments, the boundary tick combines the two labels as \
end|start.", "Notes"], Cell["The result is a framed Graphics object. Invalid paths, sampling counts, rules, tick \
specifications, font settings, or nonnumeric Hamiltonians return $Failed with a message.", "Notes"],
     Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{{Cell["      ", "TableRowIcon"], "\"PlotRange\"", "All",
